{"story_id":102795,"updated_at":"2026-11-28T17:24:26","headline_en":"Kolkata tennis: 14-year-old Jensi Kanabar advances to professional singles final","headline_hi":"कोलकाता टेनिस: 14 वर्षीय जेन्सी कनाबर पेशेवर एकल फाइनल में पहुंचीं","payload_en":{"story_id":102795,"headline":"Kolkata tennis: 14-year-old Jensi Kanabar advances to professional singles final","counts":{"articles":2,"independent_sources":2,"outlets":2},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"express","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["News18","Times of India"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":34028,"parents":[{"story_id":77513,"headline":"Kumamoto Masters: Lakshya Sen defeats Koki Watanabe to claim maiden title"}],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-11-28T17:24:26","category":{"v":2,"primary":["india"],"secondary":["life"],"tertiary":["sport-films"]},"places":["west-bengal"],"people":["Jensi Kanabar","Madelyn Nugroho","Kamonwan Yodpetch","Maria Kalyakina","Fang An Lin","Maria Pankratova","Onyu Choi","Elena Jamshidi"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"Jensi Kanabar's impressive performance in Kolkata makes her the youngest Indian woman to advance to a professional singles final.","ids":[179348,179359],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"On Saturday (14 November), Indian badminton player Lakshya Sen defeated sixth seed Alwi Farhan of Indonesia in a semi-final encounter to reach the final.","ids":[-134670],"class":"single","sources":[3]}],[{"text":"Maria Kalyakina is the fourth seed from Russia. Onyu Choi and Maria Pankratova are fourth seeds. Fang An Lin and Kamonwan Yodpetch are second seeds from Taipei and Thailand.","ids":[179360,179363,179362],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"On Saturday, Kanabar defeated Florentine Dekkers in the semifinals, beat Riya Sachdeva 6-1, 6-2 at the Kolkata tournament, and defeated Elena Jamshidi 6-3, 6-0 in the second round.","ids":[179342,179335,179336],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"Lin and Kamonwan Yodpetch defeated Choi and Pankratova 6-4, 6-2 in the women's doubles final.","ids":[179339],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"Kanabar has won all four of her matches at the Kolkata tournament without dropping a set, and won the opening set 7-6(4) against Kalyakina after trailing 3-5 and 1-4 in the tie-break.","ids":[179346,179354],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"She secured a 7-6(4), 6-2 victory against Kalyakina in the quarterfinals.","ids":[179337],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"Priska Madelyn Nugroho defeated Kamonwan Yodpetch 6-1, 6-4 in the other semifinal.","ids":[179338],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Kanabar won the second set 6-2 to reach the last four.","ids":[179355],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Nugroho defeated Kamonwan Yodpetch 6-1, 6-4 in the semifinal.","ids":[179356],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"On Saturday, fourteen-year-old Kanabar reached a professional singles final at the HCL ITF W15 Kolkata tournament.","ids":[179351],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"She is aged 14 years and 11 months, and is 14 years and 11 months old.","ids":[179343,179347],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"Kanabar will compete against Priska Nugroho in Sunday's final for her maiden professional singles title.","ids":[179345],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"Nugroho will play the title clash against Nugroho.","ids":[179361],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"She has an opportunity to win her first professional singles title.","ids":[179364],"class":"single","sources":[2]}]],"section_keys":["news","background","happened","performers","performers","performers","performers","next"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://www.news18.com/sports/tennis/teenager-jensi-kanabar-breaks-sania-mirzas-24-year-old-tennis-record-ws-l-10445000.html","outlet":"News18","title":"Teenager Jensi Kanabar Breaks Sania Mirza's 24-Year-Old Tennis Record","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url