-year-old Jensi Kanabar reached a professional singles final at the HCL ITF W15 Kolkata tournament because Jensi Kanabar defeated Florentine Dekkers in the semifinals.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/tennis/top-stories/14-year-old-jensi-kanabar-scripts-history-shatters-sania-mirzas-24-year-old-record/articleshow/136250370.cms","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Jensi Kanabar won the opening set 7-6(4) against Maria Kalyakina after trailing 3-5 and 1-4 in the tie-break, and after that Jensi Kanabar won the second set 6-2 to reach the last four.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/tennis/top-stories/14-year-old-jensi-kanabar-scripts-history-shatters-sania-mirzas-24-year-old-record/articleshow/136250370.cms","stance":"asserts"}]}],"context":[{"text":"Jensi Kanabar will compete against Priska Madelyn Nugroho in Sunday's final for her maiden professional singles title.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"News18","url":"https://www.news18.com/sports/tennis/teenager-jensi-kanabar-breaks-sania-mirzas-24-year-old-tennis-record-ws-l-10445000.html","stance":"asserts"},{"outlet":"Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/tennis/top-stories/14-year-old-jensi-kanabar-scripts-history-shatters-sania-mirzas-24-year-old-record/articleshow/136250370.cms","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Madelyn Nugroho will play the title clash against Jensi Kanabar","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/tennis/top-stories/14-year-old-jensi-kanabar-scripts-history-shatters-sania-mirzas-24-year-old-record/articleshow/136250370.cms","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Jensi Kanabar has an opportunity to win her first professional singles title","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/tennis/top-stories/14-year-old-jensi-kanabar-scripts-history-shatters-sania-mirzas-24-year-old-record/articleshow/136250370.cms","stance":"asserts"}]}]},"payload_hi":{"story_id":102795,"headline":"कोलकाता टेनिस: 14 वर्षीय जेन्सी कनाबर पेशेवर एकल फाइनल में पहुंचीं","counts":{"articles":2,"independent_sources":2,"outlets":2},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"express","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["News18","Times of India"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":34028,"parents":[{"story_id":77513,"headline":"कुमामोतो मास्टर्स: लक्ष्य सेन ने अपना पहला खिताब जीतने के लिए कोकी वातानाबे को हराया"}],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-11-28T17:24:26","category":{"v":2,"primary":["india"],"secondary":["life"],"tertiary":["sport-films"]},"places":["west-bengal"],"people":["Jensi Kanabar","Madelyn Nugroho","Kamonwan Yodpetch","Maria Kalyakina","Fang An Lin","Maria Pankratova","Onyu Choi","Elena Jamshidi"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"कोलकाता में जेन्सी कनाबर का प्रभावशाली प्रदर्शन उन्हें पेशेवर एकल फाइनल में पहुंचने वाली सबसे युवा भारतीय महिला बनाता है।","ids":[179348,179359],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"On Saturday (14 November), Indian badminton player Lakshya Sen defeated sixth seed Alwi Farhan of Indonesia in a semi-final encounter to reach the final.","ids":[-134670],"class":"single","sources":[3]}],[{"text":"मारिया कालयाकिना रूस की चौथी वरीयता प्राप्त खिलाड़ी हैं। ओनयू चोई और मारिया पंक्रातोवा चौथी वरीयता प्राप्त खिलाड़ी हैं। फैंग आन लिन और कमोनवान योदपेत ताइपे और थाईलैंड की दूसरी वरीयता प्राप्त खिलाड़ी हैं।","ids":[179360,179363,179362],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"शनिवार को, कनाबर ने सेमीफाइनल में फ्लोरेंटाइन डेक्कर्ज़ को हराया, कोलकाता टूर्नामेंट में रिया सचदेवा को 6-1, 6-2 से हराया, और दूसरे दौर में एलेना जमशीदी को 6-3, 6-0 से हराया।","ids":[179342,179335,179336],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"लिन और कमोनवान योदपेत ने महिला युगल फाइनल में चोई और पंक्रातोवा को 6-4, 6-2 से हराया।","ids":[179339],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"कनाबर ने कोलकाता टूर्नामेंट में अपने चारों मैच एक भी सेट गंवाए बिना जीते हैं, और कालयाकिना के खिलाफ टाई-ब्रेक में 3-5 और 1-4 से पिछड़ने के बाद शुरुआती सेट 7-6(4) से जीता।","ids":[179346,179354],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"उन्होंने क्वार्टर फाइनल में कालयाकिना के खिलाफ 7-6(4), 6-2 से जीत हासिल की।","ids":[179337],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"प्रिस्का मैडलीन नुग्रोहो ने दूसरे सेमीफाइनल में कमोनवान योदपेत को 6-1, 6-4 से हराया।","ids":[179338],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"कनाबर ने अंतिम चार में पहुंचने के लिए दूसरा सेट 6-2 से जीता।","ids":[179355],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"नुग्रोहो ने सेमीफाइनल में कमोनवान योदपेत को 6-1, 6-4 से हराया।","ids":[179356],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"शनिवार को, चौदह वर्षीय कनाबर ने एचसीएल आईटीएफ डब्ल्यू15 कोलकाता टूर्नामेंट में पेशेवर एकल फाइनल में जगह बनाई।","ids":[179351],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"उनकी आयु 14 वर्ष 11 महीने है, और वे 14 वर्ष 11 महीने की हैं।","ids":[179343,179347],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"कनाबर अपने पहले पेशेवर एकल खिताब के लिए रविवार के फाइनल में प्रिस्का नुग्रोहो के खिलाफ प्रतिस्पर्धा करेंगी।","ids":[179345],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"नुग्रोहो, नुग्रोहो के खिलाफ खिताबी मुकाबला खेलेंगी।","ids":[179361],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"उनके पास अपना पहला पेशेवर एकल खिताब जीतने का अवसर है।","ids":[179364],"class":"single","sources":[2]}]],"section_keys":["news","background","happened","performers","performers","performers","performers","next"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://www.news18.com/sports/tennis/teenager-jensi-kanabar-breaks-sania-mirzas-24-year-old-tennis-record-ws-l-10445000.html","outlet":"News18","title":"Teenager Jensi Kanabar Breaks Sania Mirza's 24-Year-Old Tennis Record","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.